    <description><![CDATA[## What is Reasonix?

Reasonix is a coding agent for complex software engineering tasks, built around
DeepSeek models. This package installs its desktop app.

## Usage

The package installs the Reasonix desktop app. Start it from the Start Menu and connect
your model provider.
]]></description>
